*>iscobol.compiler.javac: C:\Program Files\Zulu\zulu-21\bin\javac.exe
*>================================================================*
*> SISTEMA-BANCARIO.cbl                                           *
*> Sistema Bancario Simplificado - isCOBOL 2026R1                 *
*> Autor  : INTERON                                   *            
*> Versao : 3.0 - Correcao de buffer/fluxo de telas               *
*> Data   : 2026                                                   
*>================================================================*
                                                                 
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.                                         
PROGRAM-ID. SISTEMA-BANCARIO.                                    
AUTHOR. INTERON.                                                 
DATE-WRITTEN. 2026.                                              
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.                                            
*>================================================================*
CONFIGURATION SECTION.                                           
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.                                         
OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.                                         
                                                                 
SPECIAL-NAMES.                                                   
    DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.                                      
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
DATA DIVISION.                                                   
*>================================================================*
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.                                         
                                                                 
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
*> Controle Geral                                                  
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
01 WS-CONTROLE.                                                  
   05 WS-OPCAO             PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.              
   05 WS-CONTINUAR         PIC X      VALUE "S".                 
   05 WS-TOTAL-CONTAS      PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.                   
   05 WS-PROXIMO-CONTA     PIC 9(6)   VALUE 1000.                
   05 WS-FOUND             PIC X      VALUE "N".                 
   05 WS-IDX               PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.                   
   05 WS-IDX-HIST          PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.                   
   05 WS-IDX-ORIGEM        PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.                   
   05 WS-IDX-DESTINO       PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.                   
   05 WS-AUX-CONTADOR      PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.                   
   05 WS-LIN-WIN           PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.                   
*>   Campo buffer: drena residuos de ENTER apos ACCEPTs numericos  
   05 WS-BUFFER            PIC X(80)  VALUE SPACES.              
                                                                 
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
*> Estrutura de Contas - OCCURS 100                               *
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
01 WS-CONTAS.                                                    
   05 WS-CONTA OCCURS 100 TIMES.                                 
      10 WS-NUM-CONTA      PIC 9(6).                             
      10 WS-NOME-TITULAR   PIC X(40).                            
      10 WS-CPF            PIC X(14).                            
      10 WS-SALDO          PIC 9(12)V99.                         
      10 WS-ATIVO          PIC X.                                
      10 WS-QTD-HIST       PIC 9(3).                             
      10 WS-HISTORICO OCCURS 50 TIMES.                           
         15 WS-HIST-TIPO   PIC X(25).                            
         15 WS-HIST-VALOR  PIC 9(12)V99.                         
         15 WS-HIST-SALDO  PIC 9(12)V99.                         
                                                                 
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
*> Campos de Entrada                                              *
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
01 WS-ENTRADA.                                                   
   05 WS-IN-NUM-CONTA      PIC 9(6)     VALUE 0.                 
   05 WS-IN-NOME           PIC X(40)    VALUE SPACES.            
   05 WS-IN-CPF            PIC X(14)    VALUE SPACES.            
   05 WS-IN-SALDO-INI      PIC 9(12)V99 VALUE 0.                 
   05 WS-IN-VALOR          PIC 9(12)V99 VALUE 0.                 
   05 WS-IN-CONTA-DEST     PIC 9(6)     VALUE 0.                 
   05 WS-IN-TIPO-MOV       PIC X(25)    VALUE SPACES.            
                                                                 
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
*> Campos de Formatacao                                           *
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
01 WS-DISPLAY.                                                   
   05 WS-DISP-SALDO        PIC ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZ9,99.                   
   05 WS-DISP-VALOR        PIC ZZZ.ZZZ.ZZ9,99.                   
   05 WS-DISP-CONTA        PIC 999999.                           
   05 WS-DISP-LINHA        PIC X(72)    VALUE SPACES.            
                                                                 
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
*> Campos da Janela Grafica                                       *
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
01 WS-JANELA.                                                    
   05 WS-WIN-TITULO        PIC X(40)                             
                           VALUE " EXTRATO BANCARIO ".           
   05 WS-WIN-LIN           PIC 9(3)   VALUE 2.                   
   05 WS-WIN-COL           PIC 9(3)   VALUE 3.                   
   05 WS-WIN-LINHAS        PIC 9(3)   VALUE 24.                  
   05 WS-WIN-COLUNAS       PIC 9(3)   VALUE 74.                  
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
PROCEDURE DIVISION.                                              
*>================================================================*
                                                                 
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
*> INICIALIZAR                                                    *
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
INICIALIZAR.                                                     
    PERFORM INICIALIZAR-TABELAS                                  
    MOVE "S"    TO WS-CONTINUAR                                  
    PERFORM MENU-PRINCIPAL                                       
        UNTIL WS-CONTINUAR = "N"                                 
    STOP RUN.                                                    
                                                                 
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
*> INICIALIZAR-TABELAS                                            *
*>----------------------------------------------------------------*
INICIALIZAR-TABELAS.                                             
    MOVE 0    TO WS-TOTAL-CONTAS                                 
    MOVE 1000 TO WS-PROXIMO-CONTA                                
    PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1                           
        UNTIL WS-IDX > 100                                       
        MOVE 0      TO WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-IDX)                      
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-NOME-TITULAR(WS-IDX)                   
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-CPF(WS-IDX)                            
        MOVE 0      TO WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)                          
        MOVE "N"    TO WS-ATIVO(WS-IDX)                          
        MOVE 0      TO WS-QTD-HIST(WS-IDX)                       
        PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX-HIST FROM 1 BY 1                  
            UNTIL WS-IDX-HIST > 50                               
            MOVE SPACES TO WS-HIST-TIPO(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)     
            MOVE 0      TO WS-HIST-VALOR(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)    
            MOVE 0      TO WS-HIST-SALDO(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)    
        END-PERFORM                                              
    END-PERFORM.                                                 
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> MENU-PRINCIPAL                                                 *
*>================================================================*
MENU-PRINCIPAL.                                                  
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
*>    Limpa a opcao antes de ler para evitar residuos de buffer    
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-OPCAO                                      
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY "      SISTEMA BANCARIO ISCOBOL 2026R1              "
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  1 - Criar Conta"                                  
    DISPLAY "  2 - Consultar Conta"                              
    DISPLAY "  3 - Depositar"                                    
    DISPLAY "  4 - Sacar"                                        
    DISPLAY "  5 - Transferir"                                   
    DISPLAY "  6 - Extrato"                                      
    DISPLAY "  7 - Listar Contas"                                
    DISPLAY "  0 - Sair"                                         
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  Opcao: " WITH NO ADVANCING                        
    ACCEPT WS-OPCAO                                              
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    EVALUATE WS-OPCAO(1:1)                                       
        WHEN "1"                                                 
            PERFORM CRIAR-CONTA                                  
        WHEN "2"                                                 
            PERFORM CONSULTAR-CONTA                              
        WHEN "3"                                                 
            PERFORM DEPOSITAR                                    
        WHEN "4"                                                 
            PERFORM SACAR                                        
        WHEN "5"                                                 
            PERFORM TRANSFERIR                                   
        WHEN "6"                                                 
            PERFORM EXIBIR-EXTRATO                               
        WHEN "7"                                                 
            PERFORM LISTAR-CONTAS                                
        WHEN "0"                                                 
            DISPLAY "  Encerrando o sistema. Obrigado!"          
            DISPLAY " "                                          
            MOVE "N" TO WS-CONTINUAR                             
        WHEN OTHER                                               
            DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Opcao invalida. Tente novamente."  
            PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                               
    END-EVALUATE.                                                
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> CRIAR-CONTA                                                    *
*>================================================================*
CRIAR-CONTA.                                                     
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY "            CRIAR NOVA CONTA                       "
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    IF WS-TOTAL-CONTAS >= 100                                    
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Limite de 100 contas atingido."        
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO CRIAR-CONTA-FIM                                    
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-IN-NOME                                    
    DISPLAY "  Nome do Titular : " WITH NO ADVANCING             
    ACCEPT WS-IN-NOME                                            
    IF WS-IN-NOME = SPACES                                       
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Nome nao pode ser vazio."              
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO CRIAR-CONTA-FIM                                    
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-IN-CPF                                     
    DISPLAY "  CPF             : " WITH NO ADVANCING             
    ACCEPT WS-IN-CPF                                             
    IF WS-IN-CPF = SPACES                                        
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] CPF nao pode ser vazio."               
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO CRIAR-CONTA-FIM                                    
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-SALDO-INI                                    
    DISPLAY "  Saldo Inicial   : " WITH NO ADVANCING             
    ACCEPT WS-IN-SALDO-INI                                       
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    IF WS-IN-SALDO-INI < 0                                       
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Saldo inicial nao pode ser negativo."  
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO CRIAR-CONTA-FIM                                    
    END-IF                                                       
    ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CONTAS                                     
    MOVE WS-PROXIMO-CONTA  TO WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS)      
    MOVE WS-IN-NOME        TO WS-NOME-TITULAR(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS)   
    MOVE WS-IN-CPF         TO WS-CPF(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS)            
    MOVE WS-IN-SALDO-INI   TO WS-SALDO(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS)          
    MOVE "S"               TO WS-ATIVO(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS)          
    MOVE 0                 TO WS-QTD-HIST(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS)       
    ADD 1 TO WS-PROXIMO-CONTA                                    
    IF WS-IN-SALDO-INI > 0                                       
        MOVE WS-TOTAL-CONTAS TO WS-IDX                           
        MOVE "Saldo Inicial"  TO WS-IN-TIPO-MOV                  
        PERFORM REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO                              
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS) TO WS-DISP-CONTA          
    MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-TOTAL-CONTAS)      TO WS-DISP-SALDO         
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  ================================"                 
    DISPLAY "  CONTA CRIADA COM SUCESSO!"                        
    DISPLAY "  Numero : " WS-DISP-CONTA                          
    DISPLAY "  Titular: " WS-IN-NOME                             
    DISPLAY "  CPF    : " WS-IN-CPF                              
    DISPLAY "  Saldo  : R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO                       
    DISPLAY "  ================================"                 
    PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER.                                      
CRIAR-CONTA-FIM.                                                 
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> CONSULTAR-CONTA                                                *
*>================================================================*
CONSULTAR-CONTA.                                                 
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY "            CONSULTAR CONTA                        "
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                    
    DISPLAY "  Numero da Conta : " WITH NO ADVANCING             
    ACCEPT WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                       
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    PERFORM LOCALIZAR-CONTA                                      
    IF WS-FOUND = "N"                                            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Conta nao encontrada."                 
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO CONSULTAR-CONTA-FIM                                
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)     TO WS-DISP-SALDO                   
    MOVE WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-IDX) TO WS-DISP-CONTA                   
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  ================================"                 
    DISPLAY "  DADOS DA CONTA"                                   
    DISPLAY "  ================================"                 
    DISPLAY "  Conta  : " WS-DISP-CONTA                          
    DISPLAY "  Titular: " WS-NOME-TITULAR(WS-IDX)                
    DISPLAY "  CPF    : " WS-CPF(WS-IDX)                         
    DISPLAY "  Saldo  : R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO                       
    DISPLAY "  ================================"                 
    PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER.                                      
CONSULTAR-CONTA-FIM.                                             
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> DEPOSITAR                                                      *
*>================================================================*
DEPOSITAR.                                                       
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY "                  DEPOSITO                         "
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                    
    DISPLAY "  Numero da Conta  : " WITH NO ADVANCING            
    ACCEPT WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                       
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    PERFORM LOCALIZAR-CONTA                                      
    IF WS-FOUND = "N"                                            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Conta nao encontrada."                 
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO DEPOSITAR-FIM                                      
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-VALOR                                        
    DISPLAY "  Valor do Deposito: " WITH NO ADVANCING            
    ACCEPT WS-IN-VALOR                                           
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    IF WS-IN-VALOR <= 0                                          
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Valor deve ser maior que zero."        
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO DEPOSITAR-FIM                                      
    END-IF                                                       
    ADD WS-IN-VALOR TO WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)                          
    MOVE "Deposito" TO WS-IN-TIPO-MOV                            
    PERFORM REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO                                  
    MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX) TO WS-DISP-SALDO                       
    MOVE WS-IN-VALOR       TO WS-DISP-VALOR                      
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  Deposito de R$ " WS-DISP-VALOR " efetuado!"       
    DISPLAY "  Novo Saldo : R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO                   
    PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER.                                      
DEPOSITAR-FIM.                                                   
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> SACAR                                                          *
*>================================================================*
SACAR.                                                           
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY "                    SAQUE                          "
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                    
    DISPLAY "  Numero da Conta  : " WITH NO ADVANCING            
    ACCEPT WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                       
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    PERFORM LOCALIZAR-CONTA                                      
    IF WS-FOUND = "N"                                            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Conta nao encontrada."                 
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO SACAR-FIM                                          
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-VALOR                                        
    DISPLAY "  Valor do Saque   : " WITH NO ADVANCING            
    ACCEPT WS-IN-VALOR                                           
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    IF WS-IN-VALOR <= 0                                          
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Valor deve ser maior que zero."        
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO SACAR-FIM                                          
    END-IF                                                       
    IF WS-IN-VALOR > WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)                            
        MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX) TO WS-DISP-SALDO                   
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Saldo insuficiente."                   
        DISPLAY "  Saldo disponivel: R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO          
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO SACAR-FIM                                          
    END-IF                                                       
    SUBTRACT WS-IN-VALOR FROM WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)                   
    MOVE "Saque" TO WS-IN-TIPO-MOV                               
    PERFORM REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO                                  
    MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX) TO WS-DISP-SALDO                       
    MOVE WS-IN-VALOR       TO WS-DISP-VALOR                      
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  Saque de R$ " WS-DISP-VALOR " efetuado!"          
    DISPLAY "  Novo Saldo : R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO                   
    PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER.                                      
SACAR-FIM.                                                       
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> TRANSFERIR                                                     *
*>================================================================*
TRANSFERIR.                                                      
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY "               TRANSFERENCIA                       "
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                    
    DISPLAY "  Conta de Origem  : " WITH NO ADVANCING            
    ACCEPT WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                       
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    PERFORM LOCALIZAR-CONTA                                      
    IF WS-FOUND = "N"                                            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Conta de origem nao encontrada."       
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO TRANSFERIR-FIM                                     
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE WS-IDX TO WS-IDX-ORIGEM                                 
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-CONTA-DEST                                   
    DISPLAY "  Conta de Destino : " WITH NO ADVANCING            
    ACCEPT WS-IN-CONTA-DEST                                      
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    IF WS-IN-CONTA-DEST = WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-IDX-ORIGEM)            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Origem e destino nao podem ser iguais."
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO TRANSFERIR-FIM                                     
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE WS-IN-CONTA-DEST TO WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                     
    PERFORM LOCALIZAR-CONTA                                      
    IF WS-FOUND = "N"                                            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Conta de destino nao encontrada."      
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO TRANSFERIR-FIM                                     
    END-IF                                                       
    MOVE WS-IDX TO WS-IDX-DESTINO                                
    MOVE 0 TO WS-IN-VALOR                                        
    DISPLAY "  Valor            : " WITH NO ADVANCING            
    ACCEPT WS-IN-VALOR                                           
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    IF WS-IN-VALOR <= 0                                          
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Valor deve ser maior que zero."        
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO TRANSFERIR-FIM                                     
    END-IF                                                       
    IF WS-IN-VALOR > WS-SALDO(WS-IDX-ORIGEM)                     
        MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX-ORIGEM) TO WS-DISP-SALDO            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Saldo insuficiente na conta de origem."
        DISPLAY "  Saldo disponivel: R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO          
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO TRANSFERIR-FIM                                     
    END-IF                                                       
    SUBTRACT WS-IN-VALOR FROM WS-SALDO(WS-IDX-ORIGEM)            
    MOVE WS-IDX-ORIGEM     TO WS-IDX                             
    MOVE "Transf. Enviada"  TO WS-IN-TIPO-MOV                    
    PERFORM REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO                                  
    ADD WS-IN-VALOR TO WS-SALDO(WS-IDX-DESTINO)                  
    MOVE WS-IDX-DESTINO    TO WS-IDX                             
    MOVE "Transf. Recebida" TO WS-IN-TIPO-MOV                    
    PERFORM REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO                                  
    MOVE WS-IN-VALOR              TO WS-DISP-VALOR               
    MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX-ORIGEM)  TO WS-DISP-SALDO               
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  Transferencia de R$ " WS-DISP-VALOR " realizada!" 
    DISPLAY "  Saldo atual da origem: R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO         
    PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER.                                      
TRANSFERIR-FIM.                                                  
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> EXIBIR-EXTRATO                                                 *
*> Utiliza DISPLAY WINDOW do isCOBOL para janela grafica         * 
*>================================================================*
EXIBIR-EXTRATO.                                                  
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
    DISPLAY "  Numero da Conta para Extrato: " WITH NO ADVANCING 
    ACCEPT WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                       
*>    Drena buffer apos ACCEPT numerico                            
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
    PERFORM LOCALIZAR-CONTA                                      
    IF WS-FOUND = "N"                                            
        DISPLAY "  [ERRO] Conta nao encontrada."                 
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO EXIBIR-EXTRATO-FIM                                 
    END-IF                                                       
*>    Abrir janela grafica flutuante                               
    DISPLAY WINDOW                                               
        LINE    WS-WIN-LIN                                       
        COLUMN  WS-WIN-COL                                       
        LINES   WS-WIN-LINHAS                                    
        SIZE    WS-WIN-COLUNAS                                   
        TITLE   WS-WIN-TITULO                                    
        ERASE                                                    
    MOVE WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-IDX) TO WS-DISP-CONTA                   
    MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)     TO WS-DISP-SALDO                   
    DISPLAY "  ==========================================="      
        LINE 1 COLUMN 1                                          
    DISPLAY "        EXTRATO DA CONTA                   "        
        LINE 2 COLUMN 1                                          
    DISPLAY "  ==========================================="      
        LINE 3 COLUMN 1                                          
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
        LINE 4 COLUMN 1                                          
    DISPLAY "  Titular : "                                       
        LINE 5 COLUMN 1 WITH NO ADVANCING                        
    DISPLAY WS-NOME-TITULAR(WS-IDX)                              
    DISPLAY "  Conta   : "                                       
        LINE 6 COLUMN 1 WITH NO ADVANCING                        
    DISPLAY WS-DISP-CONTA                                        
    DISPLAY "  CPF     : "                                       
        LINE 7 COLUMN 1 WITH NO ADVANCING                        
    DISPLAY WS-CPF(WS-IDX)                                       
    DISPLAY "  Saldo   : R$ "                                    
        LINE 8 COLUMN 1 WITH NO ADVANCING                        
    DISPLAY WS-DISP-SALDO                                        
    DISPLAY "  -------------------------------------------"      
        LINE 9 COLUMN 1                                          
    DISPLAY "  HISTORICO DE MOVIMENTACOES"                       
        LINE 10 COLUMN 1                                         
    DISPLAY "  -------------------------------------------"      
        LINE 11 COLUMN 1                                         
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AUX-CONTADOR                                    
    IF WS-QTD-HIST(WS-IDX) = 0                                   
        DISPLAY "  Nenhuma movimentacao registrada."             
            LINE 12 COLUMN 1                                     
        MOVE 1 TO WS-AUX-CONTADOR                                
    ELSE                                                         
        PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX-HIST FROM 1 BY 1                  
            UNTIL WS-IDX-HIST > WS-QTD-HIST(WS-IDX)              
            ADD 1 TO WS-AUX-CONTADOR                             
            COMPUTE WS-LIN-WIN = 11 + WS-AUX-CONTADOR            
            MOVE WS-HIST-VALOR(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)              
                TO WS-DISP-VALOR                                 
            MOVE WS-HIST-SALDO(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)              
                TO WS-DISP-SALDO                                 
            MOVE SPACES TO WS-DISP-LINHA                         
            STRING                                               
                "  "                                             
                WS-HIST-TIPO(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)                
                " R$"                                            
                WS-DISP-VALOR                                    
                " Saldo:R$"                                      
                WS-DISP-SALDO                                    
                DELIMITED SIZE                                   
                INTO WS-DISP-LINHA                               
            END-STRING                                           
            DISPLAY WS-DISP-LINHA                                
                LINE WS-LIN-WIN COLUMN 1                         
        END-PERFORM                                              
    END-IF                                                       
    COMPUTE WS-LIN-WIN = 13 + WS-AUX-CONTADOR                    
    DISPLAY "  -------------------------------------------"      
        LINE WS-LIN-WIN COLUMN 1                                 
    COMPUTE WS-LIN-WIN = WS-LIN-WIN + 1                          
    DISPLAY "  Pressione ENTER para fechar..."                   
        LINE WS-LIN-WIN COLUMN 1                                 
*>    ACCEPT alfanumerico - nao gera residuo numerico no buffer    
    ACCEPT WS-BUFFER LINE WS-LIN-WIN COLUMN 1                    
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER                                     
*>    Fechar janela grafica                                        
    DISPLAY WINDOW ERASE.                                        
EXIBIR-EXTRATO-FIM.                                              
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> LISTAR-CONTAS                                                  *
*>================================================================*
LISTAR-CONTAS.                                                   
    PERFORM LIMPAR-TELA                                          
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY "              LISTA DE CONTAS                      "
    DISPLAY "==================================================="
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    IF WS-TOTAL-CONTAS = 0                                       
        DISPLAY "  Nenhuma conta cadastrada."                    
        PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER                                   
        GO TO LISTAR-CONTAS-FIM                                  
    END-IF                                                       
    DISPLAY "  Conta    Titular                   Saldo"         
    DISPLAY "  -------- ------------------------- ---------------
    PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1                           
        UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-TOTAL-CONTAS                           
        IF WS-ATIVO(WS-IDX) = "S"                                
            MOVE WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-IDX) TO WS-DISP-CONTA           
            MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)      TO WS-DISP-SALDO          
            DISPLAY "  " WS-DISP-CONTA                           
                "  " WS-NOME-TITULAR(WS-IDX)(1:25)               
                "  R$ " WS-DISP-SALDO                            
        END-IF                                                   
    END-PERFORM                                                  
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  Total de contas ativas: " WS-TOTAL-CONTAS         
    PERFORM AGUARDAR-ENTER.                                      
LISTAR-CONTAS-FIM.                                               
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> LOCALIZAR-CONTA                                                *
*> Entrada : WS-IN-NUM-CONTA                                     * 
*> Saida   : WS-FOUND (S/N), WS-IDX (indice ou 0 se nao achou)  *  
*>================================================================*
LOCALIZAR-CONTA.                                                 
    MOVE "N" TO WS-FOUND                                         
    MOVE 0   TO WS-IDX                                           
    PERFORM VARYING WS-AUX-CONTADOR FROM 1 BY 1                  
        UNTIL WS-AUX-CONTADOR > WS-TOTAL-CONTAS                  
            OR WS-FOUND = "S"                                    
        IF WS-NUM-CONTA(WS-AUX-CONTADOR) = WS-IN-NUM-CONTA       
            AND WS-ATIVO(WS-AUX-CONTADOR) = "S"                  
*>            Salva o indice DENTRO do IF, antes do VARYING        
*>            incrementar WS-AUX-CONTADOR ao retornar ao UNTIL     
            MOVE WS-AUX-CONTADOR TO WS-IDX                       
            MOVE "S"             TO WS-FOUND                     
        END-IF                                                   
    END-PERFORM.                                                 
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO                                            *
*> Entrada : WS-IDX         - indice da conta                   *  
*>           WS-IN-VALOR    - valor da operacao                  * 
*>           WS-IN-TIPO-MOV - descricao da operacao              * 
*>================================================================*
REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO.                                             
    IF WS-QTD-HIST(WS-IDX) >= 50                                 
        DISPLAY "  [AVISO] Limite de historico atingido."        
        GO TO REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO-FIM                            
    END-IF                                                       
    ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-HIST(WS-IDX)                                 
    MOVE WS-QTD-HIST(WS-IDX) TO WS-IDX-HIST                      
    MOVE WS-IN-TIPO-MOV                                          
        TO WS-HIST-TIPO(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)                     
    MOVE WS-IN-VALOR                                             
        TO WS-HIST-VALOR(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST)                    
    MOVE WS-SALDO(WS-IDX)                                        
        TO WS-HIST-SALDO(WS-IDX, WS-IDX-HIST).                   
REGISTRAR-MOVIMENTO-FIM.                                         
    CONTINUE.                                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> LIMPAR-TELA                                                    *
*>================================================================*
LIMPAR-TELA.                                                     
    DISPLAY SPACE                                                
        LINE 1 COLUMN 1                                          
        ERASE EOS                                                
    DISPLAY " ".                                                 
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> AGUARDAR-ENTER                                                 *
*> Usa PIC X(80) para drenar qualquer residuo do buffer          * 
*>================================================================*
AGUARDAR-ENTER.                                                  
    DISPLAY " "                                                  
    DISPLAY "  Pressione ENTER para continuar..."                
        WITH NO ADVANCING                                        
    ACCEPT WS-BUFFER                                             
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BUFFER.                                    
                                                                 
*>================================================================*
*> FIM DO PROGRAMA                                                *
*>================================================================*
*> --E: #287 Continuation character expected, end of literal assumed "  -------- ------------------------- ---------------; file = SISTEMA-BANCARIO.cbl, line = 556, col 12
